cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark card, please cite it as below."
title: "C5 metadata gate self-test — GIXOS pseudo-reflectivity (PETRA III P08)"
abstract: >-
  A controlled self-test for automated research-metadata suggestion. The same
  benchmark bundle is scored twice against a published SciCat record used
  unmodified as ground truth — once against faithful predictions, once against
  predictions that truncate one field and fabricate another — demonstrating
  that the deterministic gate discriminates between them without any LLM judge
  participating in the verdict.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - research data management
  - metadata quality
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
  - PaN
  - PETRA III
authors:
  - name: "PhysicsLLM C.5, Deutsches Elektronen-Synchrotron DESY"
    website: "https://physics-llm.erumdatahub.de/"
references:
  - type: data
    title: >-
      GIXOS-derived pseudo reflectivity of DPPG monolayer on tris-EDTA buffer
      surface (pH 7.3) at pi = 35mN/m, 295K
    authors:
      - family-names: Shen
        given-names: Chen
    notes: >-
      SciCat public-data/cb2f2cf8-3b59-4592-a383-706c2c91cfc4. Measured at
      PETRA III, beamline P08, Langmuir trough GID setup. Included verbatim
      under golden_label/ and used as evaluation ground truth.
